            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The bronze dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Lightning** (arcane, electricity, evocation); The dragon breathes lightning in a 60-foot line that deals 6d12 electricity damage (28 basic Reflex save).\n- **Repulsion Gas** (abjuration, arcane, incapacitation, mental); The dragon breathes a 60-foot line of repulsive gas. Each creature in the area must succeed at a 28 Will save or become fleeing from the dragon for 1 round (or 2 rounds on a critical failure)."
            },
